# play.scen -- at ai2: our turn -- dice 1 and 3 held (keys), a roll (R),
# the cursor up onto the dice and left onto the card, chance scored; the
# bots' turns (their slots lit), the standings (S) and back, the help (H)
# and back, a burst for tools/rowcheck.py, then L leaves for the list.
wait 360
press down
wait 10
press fire
wait 300
press fire
until 7A 1 900
wait 60
snap turn
key 1
key 3
wait 20
snap held
key R
wait 90
snap rolled
xram 20 16
press up
press left
wait 20
snap cursor
press fire
wait 40
snap scored
wait 60
snap reveal
until 7A 1 900
wait 30
snap turn2
burst live 60
key S
wait 120
snap stand
key S
wait 120
snap back
key H
wait 40
snap help
key SPACE
wait 120
key L
wait 300
snap left
